        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-08T01:19:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would reach out to the vendor about this. Do they even have a low power mode? I don\u0027t anticipate this API being used. If they don\u0027t, I\u0027d just drop this.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 365,
        "startChar": 0,
