      "writtenOn": "2021-12-09T18:10:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re absolutely right, they don\u0027t have low power mode. My assumption is that disabling the FETs would save power, and other PPCs disable FETs explicitly too. Why do you think this API will not be used?",
